                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="share-circle-icon">
                <a href="mailto:?subject=Economic+Outlook+and+Final+Thoughts&amp;body=https%3a%2f%2fwww.philadelphiafed.org%2fthe-economy%2fmonetary-policy%2f250605-economic-outlook-and-final-thoughts" target="_blank">
