                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                        </header>
                                        <p class="article-excerpt">When the Federal Reserve begins unwinding its $4.5 trillion balance sheet, “It will be the policy equivalent of watching paint dry,” said Patrick T. Harker, Philadelphia Fed president, in a speech in New York.</p>
